 pop up, but I just don't know exactly where it stands today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q4-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"So it was just necessary from a conversion and conducting an open season to have 1 tariff and to go to the market with 1 offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vikram Bagri","x":"We -- our analysis also shows that on crude site basis, Permian basin will be over pipe for some time and tariffs have been going down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"But the volume on S&L that you're seeing down roughly 85,000 barrels a day is virtually all NGL, and it's the streamlining that Harry mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"The key point on this is, we purchased the steel before the tariffs were implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Richardson","x":"And then not to bring up a lightning rod item, but can you talk about just tariffs surcharges to the extent that future build out pipelines, Etc., this may be something that you employ when and where the procurement process incurs these costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"And we've done a lot of work over the last year streamlining our business and taking some of the volatility out of the business, making more consistent return.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"From 1Q 2017 through 3Q 2019 we nearly doubled our Permian tariff volumes averaging quarterly growth of approximately 230000 barrels per day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"We expect Cactus II and our total Permian tariff volumes to continue to grow in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"But Sunil of the 2019 and 2020 numbers right there's a timing component a cost savings and an optimization component.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q3-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christine Cho","x":"Or did a lowering of tariff on existing long-haul pipes also play a role?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"Most of it's just a business mix and growing volumes on pipes that have lower tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2019 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"We do look at asset sales, that's been a pretty good tool in the meantime, because we do get some business streamlining and that, we think we -- ultimately that works as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the Transportation segment, our February guidance had assumed 10% volume growth from 2019 with 2020 tariff volumes averaging 7.6 million barrels per day, driven by continued Permian production growth, and in the aggregate, flat to slightly lower production in the remaining U.S. shale basins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"This is Jeremy, I think the way to think about it is, some of the spots capacity could have come off of pipelines and that's obviously higher tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"That said, we continue to challenge all investments in the current environment and are working to capture additional cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"The one nuance I want to give you is, when we are doing this, I've been in many different situations where you chase cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-lp-paa-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"Unit margins have improved, reflecting higher expected average tariff rates and our continued focus on reducing operating costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"I'll note that our updated guidance incorporates the shift between quarters of earnings related to the timing impact of MVC deficiencies relative to billing cycles and the deficiency payments are also contributing to the higher average tariff rate for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"As summarized on Slide 7, we continue to advance initiatives to optimize our asset portfolio and streamline our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"With respect to optimizing our business, we continue to streamline and drive efficiencies across all aspects of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q2","e":"paa","d":"2020-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"In addition to increasing guidance for our adjusted EBITDA, we have further reduced our 2020 and 2021 capex program by an additional $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"