earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2020-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the balance of 2020, we currently intend to allocate up to $75 million for repurchases which effectively equates to the increased 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q3-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2021-02-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Goebel","x":"So it couldn't yield lower capex outlays in Texas, but all in all, tariffs are somewhat similar between the two regions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2021-02-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"And so when you think about our system, I know I've shared this before with folks in the Permian, we had roughly 5 million tariff barrels or barrel capacity, two in gathering, two in intra-basin, one in long haul.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"First, we have fully embraced our companywide transition to efficiency mode, focusing on streamlining the organization, reducing costs, and working to optimize all aspects of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"PAA 2020 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"We also advanced optimization and efficiency initiatives throughout the year, resulting in more than $125 million of opex and G&A cost savings, which we expect to endure in 2021 and future years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcript