to streamline operations and drive growth while generating strong returns for our unitholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/08/plains-all-american-paa-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the third quarter, we reported crude oil segment adjusted EBITDA of $593 million, which benefited from higher volumes and contributions from recently completed bolt-on acquisitions as well as the impact of annual tariff escalation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"Seen on Slide eight, the combined benefits from bolt-on M&A, synergy capture, and streamlining efforts across the broader organization will provide Plains self-help tailwinds to the near-term volatility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"But just the compression and multiple to next year as step-ups in contract and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/plains-all-american-pipeline-paa-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2026-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"The market environment presented multiple challenges including geopolitical unrest, actions from OPEC to increase oil supply, and uncertainty on the economic impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/plains-all-american-paa-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2026-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"As highlighted on Slide four, despite these distractions, we remain focused on transitioning to a pure-play crude company, which also serves as a catalyst to streamline our operations and better position Plains for the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/plains-all-american-paa-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2025 Q4","e":"paa","d":"2026-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Willie Chiang","x":"And third, we're streamlining the organization with a focus on efficiency and improving our cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/plains-all-american-paa-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2026 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2026-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al P. Swanson","x":"The oil segment was increased by $60 million, driven by captured optimization opportunities, FERC tariff escalators, increased spot tariff volumes, and increased West Coast volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paa-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2026 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2026-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wilfred C.W. Chiang","x":"Our trajectory of growth this year is underpinned by three key drivers: the sale of our NGL assets, Cactus III synergy capture and streamlining.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paa-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2026 Q1","e":"paa","d":"2026-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Al P. Swanson","x":"Before handing it back to Willie, I would note that both current and deferred taxes are elevated on the statement of operations this quarter because of the restructuring activities associated with the NGL sale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/paa-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PAA 2026 Q3","e":"paa","d":"2026-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Al Swanson","x":"For the third quarter, we reported adjusted EBITDA of $711 million, reflecting the benefit of operating efficiencies, annual tariff rate esc